From 22870793fcf436242c46f3ec99df6d193f6b79e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ankit <akitsini2004@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:04:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix search focus, transport drift, save/rename keyboard, and
 preview/replace transitions

1. Search: explicit focus + native keyboard helper with retries when the
   search bar opens (autoFocus alone does not bring up the IME on
   Android 15+ edge-to-edge).
2. Transport: slide spring now jumps on first paint / re-show / cold-start
   re-attach, is over-damped (no overshoot), and both buttons use an
   explicit shared slot so the record button never drifts left.
3. Save/Rename: dialogs are now in-window overlays (RN Modal is a separate
   window whose IME never shows under edge-to-edge); staggered focus
   retries; native showSoftKeyboard walks the hierarchy for the focused
   EditText before forcing the IME.
4. Preview/Replace: playhead clock freezes across the native mode switch
   (beginSwitch/endSwitch), snapshots echoing the user-initiated start no
   longer re-anchor the clock, preview() applies an optimistic state,
   and failed switches resync from native state.
5. End behaviour: playhead stays continuous when previewing reaches the
   end (auto-pause) and when a replace pass catches up (keeps recording).
